From 94596103f46c0546a045f1d333b7dfb8b2db47c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 15:16:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD reviewed-feature completion confirmation for
 intentional closure

No-findings review results put the patch-agent session into an explicit confirmation state. The controller handles yes and no replies locally, suppresses ready highlighting for closed sessions, and reopens a closed session when later chat input should go back to the backend.
